        en: "Silent energy guzzlers also often hide in electricity usage: TVs, coffee machines, or chargers consume power around the clock in standby mode. A switchable power strip, LED bulbs, and cooking with a lid on the pot cost almost nothing — yet have a surprisingly positive effect on your bank account at year's end.",
