        en: "Every child knows that chocolate, cake, and soda contain a lot of sugar. Surprising, however, is how much sugar also hides in foods that at first glance do not seem sweet at all or even appear especially healthy — such as fruit yogurts, ready-made sauces, muesli mixes, or store-bought smoothies.",
